aja   1 Dashboard   2 Answers   3 Schedule   4 Config
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Keys

  1           Dashboard
  2           Answers
  3           Schedule
  4           Config
  ?           this list; Esc closes it
  q, Ctrl-C   quit (a run in progress keeps running)

Dashboard

  r           start a run: market, dry run or live, a maximum
  x           stop the run in progress, whoever started it
  s           the setup checklist

Answers

  Tab         pending (the review queue) or approved
  a           approve the answer as shown
  e, Enter    correct it: pick or type an option, or type the answer
  d           delete it: aja asks the question again

Schedule

  a           add a window: weekdays, hours, market, dry run or live
  Space       turn the window on or off
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
esc closes the list · q quit